      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "Spacehunter: Adventures in the Forbidden Zone (1983) emerged during the post-Star Wars 3D movie craze, riding the wave of early 80s sci-fi exploitation films. Released the same year as <a href=\"/movie/47364\" class=\"movie-title\">Metalstorm: The Destruction of Jared-Syn</a> (1983), it represents a fascinating snapshot of B-movie sci-fi trying to capitalize on both the space opera trend and the brief 3D revival. Peter Strauss channels Han Solo as a mercenary searching for three women on a plague-ravaged world, while Molly Ringwald appears in an early role before her John Hughes breakthrough in <a href=\"/movie/15144\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"15144\">Sixteen Candles</a> (1984)."
      },
      {
